    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that actually makes sense. the silence thing... it's like, he's just existing but not living. honestly it's getting a bit hard to write because it feels so real. sometimes when i'm working on his chapters i just stare at the wall for an hour and i can't even find the motivation to get up for water. it's like i'm slipping into that void with him. is it weird if the writer feels the character's stagnation too?",
